      "id": "E-001",
      "title": "Russia Luch/Olymp RPO near Franco-Italian Athena-Fidus",
      "description": "In late 2017, Russia's <i>Luch (Olymp-K)</i> satellite maneuvered into proximity with <i>Athenta-Fidus</i>, a French-Italian military communications satellite operating in GEO. <i>Luch</i> remained in the vicinity from October 2017 to January 2018. In September 2018, French Minister of the Armed Forces Florence Parly publicly characterized the encounter as an attempted act of espionage.",
